WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:00.600
Former President

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:02.268
Trump has refused to say

00:00:02.268 --> 00:00:03.169
whether he believes

00:00:03.169 --> 00:00:04.537
Russia should win the war

00:00:04.537 --> 00:00:06.072
or if Putin is a war criminal.

00:00:06.072 --> 00:00:09.542
Former Florida Governor Ron DeSantis

00:00:09.542 --> 00:00:11.077
referred to Russia's invasion

00:00:11.077 --> 00:00:12.112
of Ukraine as a, quote,

00:00:12.112 --> 00:00:14.347
territorial dispute.

00:00:14.347 --> 00:00:15.415
What do you think of that?

00:00:15.415 --> 00:00:16.783
I think that that's a mistake

00:00:16.783 --> 00:00:17.984
that too many have made.

00:00:17.984 --> 00:00:18.818
That's exactly

00:00:18.818 --> 00:00:19.953
what got the Europeans

00:00:19.953 --> 00:00:20.687
in this position

00:00:20.687 --> 00:00:22.288
with Russia in the first place,

00:00:22.288 --> 00:00:23.757
is that they're too trustful.

00:00:23.757 --> 00:00:26.159
You can't be trustful of a regime

00:00:26.159 --> 00:00:27.694
that goes in and tries to take away

00:00:27.694 --> 00:00:28.561
people's freedoms.

00:00:28.561 --> 00:00:29.896
What we need to understand

00:00:29.896 --> 00:00:32.966
is that Ukraine has the ability to win.

00:00:33.166 --> 00:00:35.135
But we have to think bigger than that.

00:00:35.135 --> 00:00:36.302
And for them to sit there

00:00:36.302 --> 00:00:36.803
and say that

00:00:36.803 --> 00:00:38.838
this is a territorial dispute,

00:00:38.838 --> 00:00:40.040
that's just not the case

00:00:40.040 --> 00:00:41.841
to say that we should stay neutral.

00:00:41.841 --> 00:00:44.310
It is in the best interests of America.

00:00:44.310 --> 00:00:45.478
It's in the best interests

00:00:45.478 --> 00:00:47.013
of our national security

00:00:47.013 --> 00:00:48.214
for Ukraine to win.

00:00:48.214 --> 00:00:49.482
We have to see this through.

00:00:49.482 --> 00:00:50.683
We have to finish it.

00:00:50.683 --> 00:00:52.986
I if I misspoke, I meant to say that.

00:00:52.986 --> 00:00:54.554
Trump refused to say whether he believes

00:00:54.554 --> 00:00:55.455
Ukraine should win the war.

00:00:55.455 --> 00:00:56.056
But you obviously know

00:00:56.056 --> 00:00:57.223
what I was talking about.

00:00:57.223 --> 00:00:58.291
You have called Putin

00:00:58.291 --> 00:00:59.659
a, quote, evil tyrant,

00:00:59.659 --> 00:01:01.327
and you've said he cannot be trusted.

00:01:01.327 --> 00:01:02.729
How do you deal with a foreign leader

00:01:02.729 --> 00:01:03.763
that you cannot trust?

00:01:03.763 --> 00:01:04.531
Well, first of all,

00:01:04.531 --> 00:01:05.832
let's look at where we are.

00:01:05.832 --> 00:01:08.568
So you've got Russia invading Ukraine.

00:01:08.568 --> 00:01:09.402
You've got North Korea

00:01:09.402 --> 00:01:10.570
testing ballistic missiles.

00:01:10.570 --> 00:01:12.472
You've got Iran trying to build a bomb.

00:01:12.472 --> 00:01:14.941
We've got chaos everywhere. Right.

00:01:14.941 --> 00:01:17.010
But none of that would have happened

00:01:17.377 --> 00:01:18.912
had we not had that debacle.

00:01:18.912 --> 00:01:20.313
In Afghanistan.

00:01:20.313 --> 00:01:22.215
The idea that we left

00:01:22.215 --> 00:01:23.383
Bagram Air Force Base

00:01:23.383 --> 00:01:25.285
in the middle of the night

00:01:25.285 --> 00:01:26.920
without telling our allies

00:01:26.920 --> 00:01:27.821
who stood shoulder

00:01:27.821 --> 00:01:29.389
to shoulder with us for decades

00:01:29.389 --> 00:01:31.424
because we asked them to be there.

00:01:31.424 --> 00:01:33.726
Think about what that told our friends.

00:01:33.726 --> 00:01:34.928
More importantly,

00:01:34.928 --> 00:01:37.097
think about what that told our enemies.

00:01:37.097 --> 00:01:39.632
So now you have this happening.

00:01:39.632 --> 00:01:41.101
None of this should have happened.

00:01:41.101 --> 00:01:42.602
Biden had a whole year

00:01:42.602 --> 00:01:44.471
to prevent that war in Ukraine,

00:01:44.471 --> 00:01:45.839
and he didn't do it.

00:01:45.839 --> 00:01:47.340
Russia surrounded Ukraine

00:01:47.340 --> 00:01:49.042
where was everybody?

00:01:49.042 --> 00:01:51.077
There was an opportunity to stop it.

00:01:51.077 --> 00:01:52.412
That's what we have to make sure.

00:01:52.412 --> 00:01:53.346
So when you're dealing with

00:01:53.346 --> 00:01:54.681
Russia and China,

00:01:54.681 --> 00:01:56.282
I'll give you an example.

00:01:56.282 --> 00:01:58.751
The Russian plane knocked down our U.S.

00:01:58.751 --> 00:01:59.919
drone a couple of weeks ago.

00:01:59.919 --> 00:02:01.287
Remember that?

00:02:01.554 --> 00:02:03.123
What do we do about it?

00:02:03.123 --> 00:02:03.723
Nothing.

00:02:03.723 --> 00:02:04.591
You know what I would have done

00:02:04.591 --> 00:02:05.558
if I was president?

00:02:05.558 --> 00:02:07.560
Put two drones up there and a fighter jet

00:02:07.560 --> 00:02:08.461
and put our naval fleet

00:02:08.461 --> 00:02:09.329
back in the Black Sea

00:02:09.329 --> 00:02:10.263
because it never should have

00:02:10.263 --> 00:02:11.231
left in the first place.

00:02:12.866 --> 00:02:13.433
Let me ask you

00:02:13.433 --> 00:02:14.033
this, because

00:02:14.033 --> 00:02:15.001
you brought up

00:02:15.001 --> 00:02:16.803
the Afghanistan withdrawal.

00:02:16.803 --> 00:02:19.572
Did you disagree with the peace treaty

00:02:19.572 --> 00:02:21.174
that was negotiated by Secretary

00:02:21.174 --> 00:02:22.842
Pompeo and President Trump

00:02:22.842 --> 00:02:25.011
that set the stage for the withdrawal

00:02:25.011 --> 00:02:27.313
in 20, 21

00:02:27.313 --> 00:02:30.083
You can never trust the Taliban.

00:02:30.183 --> 00:02:31.651
They are terrorists.

00:02:31.651 --> 00:02:32.952
They are terrorists.

00:02:32.952 --> 00:02:34.921
And part of what it means to keep

00:02:34.921 --> 00:02:36.990
America safe is to know who

00:02:37.023 --> 00:02:38.491
your enemy is.

00:02:38.491 --> 00:02:39.025
And when you're

00:02:39.025 --> 00:02:40.026
and this is what they did

00:02:40.026 --> 00:02:40.860
with the Iran deal

00:02:40.860 --> 00:02:42.662
when they went and gave all of that cash

00:02:42.662 --> 00:02:44.230
to get into the Iran deal,

00:02:44.230 --> 00:02:45.999
they thought that Iran would stop

00:02:45.999 --> 00:02:47.934
This is a regime that says death

00:02:47.934 --> 00:02:50.069
to America, death to Israel every day.

00:02:50.236 --> 00:02:52.505
No amount of money changes

00:02:52.505 --> 00:02:53.773
the way they think.

00:02:53.773 --> 00:02:55.508
So when you go to the Taliban.

00:02:55.508 --> 00:02:57.177
Yeah, they wanted all of that money.

00:02:57.177 --> 00:02:58.178
And by the way,

00:02:58.178 --> 00:03:01.014
Biden left them $7 billion worth

00:03:01.014 --> 00:03:02.315
of military equipment

00:03:02.315 --> 00:03:03.550
while they hauled out of there

00:03:03.550 --> 00:03:04.951
in the middle of the night.

00:03:04.951 --> 00:03:07.320
But when you pay terrorists off,

00:03:07.687 --> 00:03:09.989
all they do is more terrorism

00:03:09.989 --> 00:03:12.325
that doesn't ever keep anyone safe.

00:03:12.525 --> 00:03:14.561
Those are the lessons we need to learn.

00:03:14.561 --> 00:03:14.928
Those are

00:03:14.928 --> 00:03:16.196
we can't keep repeating

00:03:16.196 --> 00:03:17.764
these same mistakes over and over again.

00:03:17.764 --> 00:03:19.566
Yeah, I think they left the equipment.

00:03:19.566 --> 00:03:20.900
It's a distinction without a difference.

00:03:20.900 --> 00:03:21.534
They left the equipment

00:03:21.534 --> 00:03:22.602
for the Afghan military,

00:03:22.602 --> 00:03:23.937
but then the Afghan military

00:03:23.937 --> 00:03:26.039
does military at all. Is already fallen.

00:03:26.039 --> 00:03:26.706
We know there was no

00:03:26.706 --> 00:03:28.541
they had hauled it out of Afghanistan.

00:03:28.541 --> 00:03:29.809
So you were the U.S.

00:03:29.809 --> 00:03:30.643
ambassador to the U.N.

00:03:30.643 --> 00:03:31.344
under President Trump.

00:03:31.344 --> 00:03:33.213
As I have noted, on Friday, Mr.

00:03:33.213 --> 00:03:35.448
Trump congratulated Kim Jong un

00:03:35.682 --> 00:03:37.350
because North Korea had ascended

00:03:37.350 --> 00:03:38.885
to a leadership role in the World

00:03:38.885 --> 00:03:40.353
Health Organization.

00:03:40.353 --> 00:03:42.055
What was your reaction to that?

00:03:42.055 --> 00:03:45.058
And were you uncomfortable with how Mr.

00:03:45.058 --> 00:03:46.726
Trump dealt with

00:03:46.726 --> 00:03:48.361
and how his attitude was towards

00:03:48.361 --> 00:03:50.063
Kim Jong un while you worked at the U.N.?

00:03:50.063 --> 00:03:52.098
I mean, Kim Jong un is a thug.

00:03:52.098 --> 00:03:54.000
And if you see what he has done

00:03:54.000 --> 00:03:56.302
to his own people in North Korea,

00:03:56.302 --> 00:03:58.471
when money went to North Korea,

00:03:58.471 --> 00:04:00.073
it didn't go to feed their people.

00:04:00.073 --> 00:04:02.041
It went to feed their nuclear program.

00:04:02.041 --> 00:04:02.942
There's nothing

00:04:02.942 --> 00:04:05.078
good or decent about Kim Jong un.

00:04:05.278 --> 00:04:06.279
There's no reason

00:04:06.279 --> 00:04:07.680
we should ever congratulate

00:04:07.680 --> 00:04:08.281
the fact

00:04:08.281 --> 00:04:09.449
that they are now

00:04:09.449 --> 00:04:10.783
vice chair of the World

00:04:10.783 --> 00:04:11.884
Health Organization.

00:04:11.884 --> 00:04:12.952
And it goes to the fact

00:04:12.952 --> 00:04:13.987
that also the World Health

00:04:13.987 --> 00:04:15.822
Organization is a farce to start with.

00:04:15.822 --> 00:04:17.223
We saw that during COVID.

00:04:18.691 --> 00:04:19.792
So it did bother you

00:04:19.792 --> 00:04:20.393
and you didn't want

00:04:20.393 --> 00:04:21.060
you didn't like this

00:04:21.060 --> 00:04:22.528
congratulating of Kim Jong un

00:04:22.528 --> 00:04:23.730
and we didn't like how we dealt with him.

00:04:23.730 --> 00:04:24.731
I don't think we ever should

00:04:24.731 --> 00:04:26.699
congratulate dictators,

00:04:26.699 --> 00:04:28.301
congratulate our friends, don't

00:04:28.301 --> 00:04:29.702
congratulate our enemies.

00:04:29.702 --> 00:04:31.771
It emboldens them when we do that.

00:04:31.771 --> 00:04:34.140
So I want to go to another Iowa voter

00:04:34.140 --> 00:04:35.808
group House from Urbandale.

00:04:35.808 --> 00:04:37.610
The president of

00:04:37.710 --> 00:04:39.379
Living History farms

00:04:39.379 --> 00:04:40.713
an agricultural museum.

00:04:40.713 --> 00:04:42.482
She's also worked on Republican campaigns

00:04:42.482 --> 00:04:44.017
and in George H.W.

00:04:44.017 --> 00:04:45.385
Bush's administration.

00:04:45.385 --> 00:04:45.852
Ruth,

00:04:46.052 --> 00:04:47.253
thank you for being in Iowa

00:04:47.253 --> 00:04:48.488
so often already.

00:04:48.488 --> 00:04:49.222
We appreciate it.

00:04:49.222 --> 00:04:50.556
We're going to keep on coming back.

00:04:50.556 --> 00:04:51.658
My question is,

00:04:51.658 --> 00:04:52.825
please share your views

00:04:52.825 --> 00:04:54.961
and approach to US-China relations

00:04:55.395 --> 00:04:57.930
and its impact on trade for Iowa farmers.

00:04:58.464 --> 00:04:59.299
Great question.

00:04:59.299 --> 00:05:00.033
So China,

00:05:00.033 --> 00:05:02.502
without question, is our number one

00:05:02.502 --> 00:05:04.804
national security threat.

00:05:04.804 --> 00:05:06.939
And let's go back in history.

00:05:06.939 --> 00:05:08.241
For too long,

00:05:08.241 --> 00:05:10.376
Republican and Democrat presidents

00:05:10.610 --> 00:05:12.378
thought that if they were nice to China,

00:05:12.378 --> 00:05:14.213
China would want to be like us.

00:05:14.213 --> 00:05:15.648
That's narcissistic.

00:05:15.648 --> 00:05:16.616
China's blessing.

00:05:16.616 --> 00:05:19.085
China does not want to be like us.

00:05:19.085 --> 00:05:20.820
They want to be communist China.

00:05:20.820 --> 00:05:23.089
We have to change the way we treat them.

00:05:23.589 --> 00:05:24.424
So if you know

00:05:24.424 --> 00:05:26.559
that, let's look at where China is now.

00:05:26.559 --> 00:05:28.161
They've built up their military.

00:05:28.161 --> 00:05:29.595
They have the largest naval fleet

00:05:29.595 --> 00:05:30.029
in the world.

00:05:30.029 --> 00:05:30.563
They have more

00:05:30.563 --> 00:05:32.398
air defense systems than we do

00:05:32.398 --> 00:05:33.299
They just came out

00:05:33.299 --> 00:05:35.101
with the fifth generation fighter jet.

00:05:35.101 --> 00:05:35.868
Had they do it

00:05:35.868 --> 00:05:37.603
by stealing our intellectual property

00:05:37.603 --> 00:05:39.706
that we handed them on a silver platter.

00:05:40.206 --> 00:05:42.742
They steal $600 billion worth

00:05:42.742 --> 00:05:44.243
of intellectual property from us

00:05:44.243 --> 00:05:45.912
every year.

00:05:45.912 --> 00:05:47.680
President Xi started a commission

00:05:47.680 --> 00:05:49.048
that he personally chairs,

00:05:49.048 --> 00:05:50.249
says any company

00:05:50.249 --> 00:05:52.051
that does business in China

00:05:52.051 --> 00:05:52.985
has to cooperate

00:05:52.985 --> 00:05:54.620
with the Chinese military.

00:05:54.620 --> 00:05:56.456
Think about our tech companies.

00:05:56.456 --> 00:05:58.758
Think about all of our financial data.

00:05:58.758 --> 00:06:00.960
Think about all of your health care data.

00:06:00.960 --> 00:06:02.095
Think about your children's

00:06:02.095 --> 00:06:03.329
lifestyle data.

00:06:03.329 --> 00:06:05.665
And now know that the Chinese military

00:06:05.665 --> 00:06:06.332
has all of that.

00:06:06.332 --> 00:06:08.568
President Xi has said whoever owns

00:06:09.068 --> 00:06:10.603
the data owns the world.

00:06:10.603 --> 00:06:11.437
And that's why

00:06:11.437 --> 00:06:12.772
they're sending spy balloons.

00:06:12.772 --> 00:06:13.773
That's why they're buying up

00:06:13.773 --> 00:06:15.641
400,000 worth of acres

00:06:15.641 --> 00:06:16.542
worth of farmland

00:06:16.542 --> 00:06:17.877
near our most sensitive

00:06:17.877 --> 00:06:19.712
military installations.

00:06:19.712 --> 00:06:21.314
That's what they're doing now.

00:06:21.314 --> 00:06:22.215
Having said that.

00:06:22.215 --> 00:06:23.383
How do you deal with China

00:06:23.383 --> 00:06:24.917
when you know we've got an economy

00:06:24.917 --> 00:06:27.053
that's so intertwined?

00:06:28.187 --> 00:06:28.921
You do it

00:06:28.921 --> 00:06:31.357
through a national security lens.

00:06:31.557 --> 00:06:32.358
Strictly

00:06:32.358 --> 00:06:34.026
through a national security lens.

00:06:34.026 --> 00:06:35.728
So I don't care if Americans buy

00:06:35.728 --> 00:06:37.697
T-shirts and light bulbs from China

00:06:37.697 --> 00:06:39.632
any more than I care of that

00:06:39.632 --> 00:06:41.167
if the Chinese buy

00:06:41.167 --> 00:06:43.469
agricultural products from our farmers,

00:06:43.469 --> 00:06:44.504
I welcome that.

00:06:44.504 --> 00:06:45.905
What I do care about is

00:06:45.905 --> 00:06:47.540
if it's a national security risk.

00:06:47.540 --> 00:06:49.475
When you saw we had COVID,

00:06:49.475 --> 00:06:51.177
they told you to put on a mask

00:06:51.177 --> 00:06:52.912
the masks were made in China.

00:06:52.912 --> 00:06:55.081
They told you to take a home COVID test.

00:06:55.081 --> 00:06:56.916
You turned it over. It was made in China.

00:06:56.916 --> 00:06:58.951
You go down to your local drugstore.

00:06:59.185 --> 00:07:01.220
All those medicines are made in China.

00:07:01.320 --> 00:07:02.455
What I will bless you.

00:07:02.455 --> 00:07:04.757
What I will focus on is

00:07:05.191 --> 00:07:07.160
when when I become president,

00:07:07.160 --> 00:07:08.494
the very first day,

00:07:08.494 --> 00:07:09.061
you look at it

00:07:09.061 --> 00:07:09.395
and say,

00:07:09.395 --> 00:07:10.730
if China pulled the rug out

00:07:10.730 --> 00:07:12.432
from under us tomorrow,

00:07:12.432 --> 00:07:13.900
would we be ready?

00:07:13.900 --> 00:07:15.635
Would we be safe?

00:07:15.635 --> 00:07:16.836
That's what we need to do.

00:07:16.836 --> 00:07:19.005
So I don't want us exporting

00:07:19.005 --> 00:07:20.606
any tech equipment to them.

00:07:21.541 --> 00:07:21.974
I want

00:07:21.974 --> 00:07:23.209
us to make sure we're focused

00:07:23.209 --> 00:07:25.011
and by the way, for our farmers.

00:07:25.011 --> 00:07:26.112
I don't want our farmers

00:07:26.112 --> 00:07:28.314
to just sell to China.

00:07:28.314 --> 00:07:29.782
I will be their ambassador

00:07:29.782 --> 00:07:30.650
in South Carolina.

00:07:30.650 --> 00:07:31.284
When I was governor,

00:07:31.284 --> 00:07:33.352
I sold South Carolina to everyone.

00:07:33.352 --> 00:07:35.655
I will sell our our farmers

00:07:35.721 --> 00:07:37.256
and all of their products

00:07:37.256 --> 00:07:39.325
to Japan, to Australia,

00:07:39.325 --> 00:07:41.160
to South Korea, to Israel.

00:07:41.160 --> 00:07:43.229
We can sell it to other countries.

00:07:43.696 --> 00:07:45.998
So you mentioned Taiwan earlier

00:07:46.799 --> 00:07:50.002
about Ukraine and Russia being Russian,

00:07:50.002 --> 00:07:51.137
meaning Ukraine could embolden

00:07:51.137 --> 00:07:52.205
China to invade Taiwan.

00:07:52.205 --> 00:07:53.406
It's one of the biggest flashpoints,

00:07:53.406 --> 00:07:53.906
as you know,

00:07:53.906 --> 00:07:55.074
in the US-China relationship.

00:07:55.074 --> 00:07:56.209
And President Biden

00:07:56.209 --> 00:07:58.010
has repeatedly said that U.S.

00:07:58.010 --> 00:08:00.246
forces would defend Taiwan

00:08:00.246 --> 00:08:01.781
if China invades.

00:08:01.781 --> 00:08:03.349
Would you make that same commitment?

00:08:03.349 --> 00:08:04.984
Well, I think he's looking at this

00:08:04.984 --> 00:08:07.487
the wrong way. It's about preventing war.

00:08:07.520 --> 00:08:09.155
So what will prevent China

00:08:09.155 --> 00:08:10.590
from even going into Taiwan

00:08:10.590 --> 00:08:11.657
in the first place?

00:08:11.657 --> 00:08:12.592
There are two things

00:08:12.592 --> 00:08:13.392
that China and Russia

00:08:13.392 --> 00:08:14.961
never wanted us to have.

00:08:14.961 --> 00:08:15.962
They never wanted us

00:08:15.962 --> 00:08:17.363
to have a strong military

00:08:17.363 --> 00:08:18.397
and they never wanted us

00:08:18.397 --> 00:08:19.665
to be energy independent.

00:08:19.665 --> 00:08:21.534
We need to do both of those things.

00:08:21.534 --> 00:08:23.503
Strong militaries don't start wars.

00:08:23.503 --> 00:08:25.404
Strong militaries prevent wars.

00:08:25.404 --> 00:08:26.606
That's the first thing that we

